# pnpm pack / npm pack tarballs (local build artifacts).
# `pack/` is the canonical output dir — `pnpm pack:local` writes there, and
# consumers bridge to it during pre-publication local iteration (see the
# vendored-tarball rule in the consumers' CLAUDE.md). The whole directory is
# ignored; the bare `*.tgz` line stays as a safety net for stray tarballs.
/pack/
*.tgz
